[{"title":"赤嵌荔支词 其四","author":"谢金銮","text":"红罗仙子下瑶台，斋馆春风席上回。\n便与赤嵌书地产，此行端为荔支来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4949,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"檨 其一","author":"谢金銮","text":"篾络筠篮到处攒，黄金青玉乱堆盘。\n陂塘夏税争鱼市，园圃秋租补橘官。\n投老风情甘润滑，少年趣味太辛酸。\n儿家一碗蓬莱酱，待与神仙下箸餐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4950,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"檨 其二","author":"谢金銮","text":"呼名谬与蒜同科，吮蜜含浆到口和。\n锦字旧从翻夹漈，金刀今见剖如何。\n凉天晓市争坡早，斜日高林坠果多。\n不与长卿忧渴病，碧盂常并地波罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4951,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郑六亭先生同游法华寺","author":"谢金銮","text":"避炎无计作逃奔，日日邀人款寺门。\n世事竟须从佛化，古人幸得到今论。\n断虹残雨南湖院，粥鼓茶香梦蝶园。\n赖有郑虔歌当泣，灯前霁月上修垣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4952,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鲫鱼潭有作 其一","author":"谢金銮","text":"层城晓出度岩扃，喜见潭光照眼青。\n烟树人家湖上店，沙洲官澳渡边亭。\n山从乌顶分东郡，水到鲲身达北溟。\n但说鲫鱼鳞甲薄，一天风雨是龙灵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4953,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鲫鱼潭有作 其二","author":"谢金銮","text":"形役劳劳总未休，此心空有买山求。\n鸱夷湖外思浮宅，钴鉧潭西赋小邱。\n蛮女紫菱归棹晚，溪翁红鲫放笭秋。\n淳风如此真堪乐，不悔他乡汗漫游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4954,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塭岸桥","author":"谢金銮","text":"浦溆溪洲好寄桡，诸罗旧县路迢迢。\n稻花香里湖菱熟，梦过扬州一半桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4955,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五妃墓","author":"谢金銮","text":"厓山一块肉无存，荒陇萧萧古墓昏。\n水国有魂追帝子，交衢无计脱王孙。\n秋风乱冢红夷塞，落日寒潮赤嵌门。\n留得东南残碣在，故宫花草向谁论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4956,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台中夏晷长于中土者数刻岁壬申1752六月望后一日课士因拈唐文宗我爱夏日长之句为题实写现景非赋古也书此以示诸生","author":"谢家树","text":"天形如覆釜，两轴定四方。\n北仰南倾泻，远睇殊混茫。\n入地三十六，未尽浑天量。\n闻到小昆崙，北斗失其疆。\n大星古无纪，南极现瑩芒。\n所以谈海外，明晦颇异常。\n初三不云朏，昨夜已生光。\n因之测日景，加刻夏尤长。\n天低与水接，黄垆半相望。\n羲和方转驭，金乌早拂桑。\n火轮就浣濯，摩荡添焜煌。\n一跃高十丈，中土尚黎苍。\n虎头迄鸡尾，乃入虞渊藏。\n羊脾熟未久，恍惚势欲翔。\n炎帝勤属辖，丙丁恋故乡。\n我来当五月，日爱薰风凉。\n官閒无浊热，署厂纳虚旸。\n笔砚新位置，书卷启尘囊。\n几净挨木凳，窗白倚竹床。\n榕午垂正阴，檨舂侧西墙。\n触处供清吟，茶馀巡空廊。\n导意使和缓，练神俾固强。\n眷彼草芊芊，带翠上我堂。\n谁家养白鸠，滑滑叫昏黄。\n绰有故园趣，以此足相羊。\n好景公同人，意切词乃昌。\n莫作寻常题，学舌赋晚唐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4957,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"下弦月观鹿耳门渔火","author":"韩必昌","text":"夜深群动息，气凉暑渐无。\n坐觉幽意适，徙倚阁东隅。\n正值新晴后，烟树稍模糊。\n沉沉半钩月，利露幽光孤。\n遥望鹿耳门，隐隐平沙铺。\n少焉月渐升，纷射鼋鼍居。\n错落渔火集，闪烁出菰芦。\n将与疏星杂，上下明空虚。\n风静波不兴，海面一镜如。\n皑皑东方白，拍拍惊啼乌。\n骤寒逼衣裳，吾将归吾庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4958,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有客问台湾土风者以此答之","author":"韩必昌","text":"瀛壖久已沾声教，耕凿共安饮食天。\n渔火红摇官渡月，樵担绿破雉墙烟。\n谁沉铁网将奇采，空把灵犀向海燃。\n夜夜花村鸡犬散，太平时世任高眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4959,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游竹溪寺观壁上溪西鸡齐啼限韵诸作戏效之复纳十二支其中知小技无当大雅姑存之","author":"韩必昌","text":"闻道竹溪胜虎溪，龙潭蛇穴夹东西。\n骑羊客解谈刍狗，脱兔僧能养木鸡。\n牛奶果垂松径满，鼠姑花发药阑齐。\n拚将系马烧猪肉，无奈归猪绕树啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4960,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安平阅武晚归","author":"觉罗四明","text":"荷兰城外静鲸鲵，细柳军容振鼓鼙。\n旌旆冲波光闪烁，艨艟拍浪影离迷。\n王朝赫赫声灵远，海国桓桓步伐齐。\n却喜归来乘暮汐，沙灯渔火满长堤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4961,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁门烟雨","author":"龚帝臣","text":"雁岭层层拥翠微，一空烟雨漫山飞。\n前村踏到园林外，湿透花香近竹扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4962,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其一","author":"仝卜年","text":"四围修竹荫檀栾，廉外青山挂笏看。\n领识閒中风味别，头衔未碍是粗官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4963,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其二","author":"仝卜年","text":"金猊香袅麝烟凝，小榻横窗月半棱。\n花影撩人诗思动，矮笺新试短棨灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4964,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其三","author":"仝卜年","text":"瓜皮艇子短篙撑，傍柳依花绕岸行。\n载看米家书画稿，春风一路听禽声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4965,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其四","author":"仝卜年","text":"溪南溪北草痕肥，山后山前布谷飞。\n叱犊一声烟雨细，杏花村里劝农归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4966,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其五","author":"仝卜年","text":"芙蓉小沼近东偏，出水亭亭态更妍。\n一幅西湖新画稿，中央只欠采莲船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4967,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其六","author":"仝卜年","text":"丛丛秋菊灿篱东，赏到黄昏兴未穷。\n夜静不知风露冷，满身花影月明中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4968,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其七","author":"仝卜年","text":"一夜秋风拂鬓华，萧然兴味似山家。\n幅巾短褐西窗下，黄叶煨炉自煮茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4969,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳即事 其八","author":"仝卜年","text":"凭栏徙倚到斜曛，镇日消閒只看云。\n疏懒自安庸吏拙，不须摘发颂神君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4970,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"职守","author":"李若琳","text":"职守鸡笼北，疆逾马赛东。\n民岩深顾畏，獠岛悉帡幪。\n浑噩风犹在，钩辀语渐通。\n专城肩钜任，曷敢贷微躬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4971,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月季花","author":"李若琳","text":"月季花开应月明，幽芳艳质四时荣。\n光华未许虻䗽蚀，免使东坡和再生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4972,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹城","author":"李若琳","text":"设险城何恃，周遮竹四围。\n由来森干节，亦足固藩篱。\n疏漏宜增补，倾欹恐易危。\n即今犀角盛，莫使鼠牙亏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4973,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛桑","author":"李若琳","text":"果否佛桑属尔魂，酡颜日映扶桑暾。\n居官若概同仓庚，富贵真看到子孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4974,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即事","author":"李若琳","text":"自我符分蛤仔难，佛桑月桂日流丹。\n蒲葵讵肯逢秋弃，松柏无因傲岁寒。\n淫雨客疑天或漏，和风人庆海安澜。\n诸生努力操铅椠，莫遣山前笑弹丸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4975,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"形势","author":"李若琳","text":"枕山三面峻，襟海一更横。\n草昧荒前代，梯航本大清。\n龟趺蹲砥柱，鸟道辟榛荆。\n笑指奇莱外，闻风意已倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4976,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"防番","author":"李若琳","text":"界未标铜柱，疆曾划土牛。\n犬羊区异类，糜鹿信同俦。\n奈有髑髅癖，能无性命忧。\n抽藤与伐木，莫浪越山头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4977,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祀灶","author":"李若琳","text":"水火资生活，庖厨藉割烹。\n人间炊爨主，天上屈伸衡。\n见说仙舆驾，均于此日行。\n缅怀俞净意，精白寸心盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4978,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"迎春","author":"李若琳","text":"凤纪颁夷岛，鸿钧入后台。\n人方循海迓，天已送春来。\n岁稔民同乐，官微老暗催。\n捧符经半载，步德未能该。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4979,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海防","author":"李若琳","text":"路自台阳出，隆隆始一湾。\n四围皆大海，五省仗雄关。\n天堑飞难渡，楼船利足患。\n圣朝虽恃德，不敢弛防闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4980,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"李若琳","text":"欲与民更始，胥将旧染除。\n一年终此夕，万户贴新符。\n老去心犹壮，春来病欲苏。\n天教能健饭，不必到澎湖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4981,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"敦俗","author":"李若琳","text":"乾坤大父母，君相正陶甄。\n莫漫分三籍，由来似一人。\n田园沟洫共，歌舞岁时亲。\n兰地虽初辟，桃源合与邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4982,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"编审","author":"李若琳","text":"地列东西势，庄分四五围。\n浚圳将水导，编甲以戈推。\n兔窟营空狡，鱼鳞册易知。\n普天皆食德，诡寄亦何为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4983,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"讲学","author":"李若琳","text":"经史传心学，诗篇养性情。\n如何凭记诵，止以弋科名。\n身世无殊轨，亲疏有定衡。\n春风浴沂意，领此在儒生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4984,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"罗汉脚","author":"李若琳","text":"盛世无夫布，仍多浪荡身。\n须知罗汉脚，半是掷金人。\n任肆萑苻虐，终罹法网新。\n孰操随会法，俾尔尽逃秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4985,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉山积雪","author":"李祺生","text":"元圃层城记未真，玉峰缥渺见精神。\n天遥岭海偏凝雪，地近蓬山讶砌银。\n六出花飘云气碾，全台源衍瑞光沦。\n何年分得昆岗脉，来障东南半壁新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4986,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石洞嘘风","author":"李祺生","text":"玲珑石窍郁层岚，披拂烟云橐籥探。\n不用投胶酬巽二，自将挥扇转轮三。\n长天风色微茫合，近海潮声澒洞涵。\n料得吹嘘真力满，扶摇可藉汝图南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4987,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"沙喃秋水","author":"李祺生","text":"沙喃叭哩溯滩头，万壑千岩泻素秋。\n山捲云烟开北向，水分清浊合东流。\n金沙泉溢寒光沸，玉岫源倾练彩浮。\n闻道瞿唐常倒峡，此间原自有龙湫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4988,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龟山朝日","author":"李祺生","text":"灵峰孤耸海东尊，高挹朝阳势欲吞。\n吸退晓岚开蜃市，吹残宿雨霁龙门。\n几番膏泽颐间出，万水朝宗肘下奔。\n谁向斑斓占吉兆，波光犹映墨留痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4989,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番橘","author":"沈光文","text":"枝头俨若挂繁星，此地何堪比洞庭。\n除是土番寻得到，满筐携出小金铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4990,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望玉山","author":"周钟瑄","text":"晓岚高捲日初生，一片晴光照眼明。\n积雪不消三伏后，层冰常讶四时成。\n疑他匹练非吴市，遮莫胥涛向越城。\n大璞已教天地凿，山灵稳卧不须惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4991,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生番歌","author":"柯培元","text":"风藤缠挂傀儡山，山前山后阴且寒。\n怪石丛箐巨龟卧，横根老干修蛇盘。\n呦鹿成群觅仙草，捷猿结伴寻甘泉。\n蕉叶为庐竹为壁，松皮作瓦棕作椽。\n中有毛人聚赤族，喧作鸟语攀云端。\n黔面文身喜跳舞，唐人头颅汉人奸。\n或言嬴秦遣徐福，或言零丁洋贩船。\n或言云南梁王后，或言日本荷兰传。\n不识不知竟太古，以似以续为葛天。\n薙发输饷归王化，女则学织男耕田。\n人生大欲先饮食，此辈喜见汉衣冠。\n我朝舆图轶千古，梯山杭海暨极边。\n天之所生地所载，几希禽兽诚可叹。\n吁嗟乎，此亦穷黎无告者，圣人仁政怀与安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4992,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过草岭","author":"柯培元","text":"荒草没人作风浪，我御天风绝顶上。\n风吹飞瀑冲石过，雾漫前山殢云涨。\n老猿攀枝窥行人，怪鸟啼烟弄新吭。\n千年老树无能名，十丈悬崖陡相向。\n下瞰大海疑幽冥，仰视天光透微亮。\n安得化险为平夷，中外同歌王道荡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4993,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"熟番歌","author":"柯培元","text":"人畏生番猛如虎，人欺熟番贱如土。\n强者畏之弱者欺，毋乃人心太不古。\n熟番归化勤躬耕，荒埔将垦唐人争。\n唐人争去饿且死，翻悔不如从前生。\n传闻城中贤父母，走向城中崩厥首。\n啁啾?格无人通，言不分明画以手。\n诉未终，官若聋。\n窃窥堂，有怒容。\n堂上怒，呼杖具。\n杖毕垂头听官谕，嗟尔番，尔何言，尔与唐人皆赤子，让耕让畔胡弗闻。\n吁嗟乎，生番杀人汉奸诱，熟番独被唐人丑，为父母者虑其后。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4994,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龟山歌","author":"柯培元","text":"千岁老龟化为石，遍体绿毛眼深碧。\n蹒跚欲上蓬莱山，道逢巨鳌话仙迹。\n天风惨淡迷寒云，水路苍莽震霹雳。\n缩颈潜伏波之心，奔浪汨没露其脊。\n不计岁月皴莓苔，竟饱烟霞附砂碛。\n细草如鳞群鹿游，深涧穿胁老猿据。\n我家东鲁有龟山，宣圣奏琴何戚戚。\n我望金沙有龟山，迩英说书叹啧啧。\n兹龟避地兼避人，不为世人十朋锡。\n我行正值春风生，遥见空中翠新滴。\n曳尾波中甘沉堙，昂首天外去咫尺。\n更闻中央澄清潭，中有金鲤化梭掷。\n吁嗟乎，龟兮龟兮如有灵，力捍蛟龙斩荆棘。\n买山有愿终乘桴，此间支床学闭息。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4995,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"噶玛兰北关","author":"孙尔准","text":"山头乱石金华羊，下饮大澥波茫茫。\n蹴蹋洪涛溅飞沫，紫澜迅激浮惊霜。\n北关拔起通一线，訇然石扇森开张。\n天开地辟绝人迹，胡烦设险劳堤防。\n我皇德远暨日出，坐变斥卤为耕桑。\n乃知天意早有在，阳施阴设成岩疆。\n我来叱驭行过此，戍卒环列排藟枪。\n关中沃野七千甲，南东其亩棻铺穰。\n茆茨土舍鸡犬静，疑从上古窥洪荒。\n鴃舌侏?费重译，见人狂顾如惊獐。\n地无可欲视听寂，安得习染生痴狂。\n无怀葛天在人世，桃源之说非荒唐。\n鳀壑东瞻寒礁石，鸡笼西顾连崇冈。\n瞿唐剑阁身未到，鄳阨视此谁低昂。\n援毫思欲勒铭去，愧无笔力追孟阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4996,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大红花","author":"乌竹芳","text":"珊瑚点缀绿云丛，海外花开别样工。\n叶似青桑微带露，葩如赤芍笑迎风。\n四时不改朝霞艳，一色常欹夕照红。\n雨后清芬飘满院，教人错认牡丹同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4997,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"木樨花","author":"乌竹芳","text":"绿叶层枝与桂同，花开蒂软怯迎风。\n经年满院天香散，不待秋清八月中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4998,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别菊花 其一","author":"乌竹芳","text":"久滞兰城厌海滨，阴云不见日华新。\n为因种菊情偏恋，冒雨初开送主人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4999,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别菊花 其二","author":"乌竹芳","text":"节过重阳又一旬，白衣送酒更无人。\n含情脉脉如将吐，笑口留开报小春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5000,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"洋玉簪","author":"乌竹芳","text":"银箭微攒雪作花，袭人香气透窗纱。\n夜深明月来相照，一伞高擎玉吐华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5001,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海涛","author":"乌竹芳","text":"缘何海啸满兰城，山雨欲来先作声。\n雪涌港门龙作吼，风摇舟楫客初惊。\n几番飞瀑从天降，一片晶帘捲地横。\n十里犹闻喧聒响，潇潇不住到平明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5002,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰城中元","author":"乌竹芳","text":"殽果层层列此筵，纸钱焚处起云烟。\n满城香烛人依户，一路歌声月在天。\n明灭灯光随水转，辉煌火炬绕街旋。\n鬼馀争食齐环向，跳跃高台欲夺先。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5003,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰城公寓寄兴","author":"乌竹芳","text":"竹声萧飒雨声催，惊破幽人午梦回。\n拂袖香风木樨放，映窗金色菊花开。\n海天已滞三秋后，乡信难逢一雁来。\n渺渺予怀添旅闷，兰舟何日渡阳台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5004,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"晓峰高出半天横，环抱沧波似镜明。\n一叶孤帆山下过，遥看红日碧涛生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5005,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"层层石磴绕青云，绿树浓阴路不分。\n半面斜阳还返照，晴烟一缕碧氤氲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5006,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"重叠青峰映碧流，西来爽气一天秋。\n山光入眼明如镜，空翠袭人无限幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5007,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"兰城锁钥扼山腰，雪浪飞腾响怒潮。\n日夕忽疑风雨至，方知万里水来朝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5008,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"碛石重重到处匀，青山四壁少居邻。\n秋来积潦无边阔，水色天光一鉴新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5009,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"石港深深口乍开，渔歌鼓棹任徘徊。\n那知一夕南风急，无数春帆带雨来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5010,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"澳水回旋地角东，山光日色照曈昽。\n蜃楼海市何人见，遥在澹烟疏雨中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5011,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰阳八景诗","author":"乌竹芳","text":"泉流泻出半清湍，独有汤围水异香。\n是否天工炉火后，浴盆把住不惊寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5012,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]